  "raw_response": "```python\ndef solve(grid):\n    if not grid or not grid[0]:\n        return grid\n    \n    rows = len(grid)\n    cols = len(grid[0])\n    \n    # Find separator value and rows\n    sep_val = None\n    sep_rows = []\n    \n    for r in range(rows):\n        first = grid[r][0]\n        if first != 0 and all(grid[r][c] == first for c in range(cols)):\n            if sep_val is None:\n                sep_val = first\n            if grid[r][0] == sep_val:\n                sep_rows.append(r)\n    \n    if sep_val is None or len(sep_rows) < 2:\n        return grid\n    \n    # Find separator columns\n    sep_cols = []\n    for c in range(cols):\n        if all(grid[r][c] == sep_val for r in range(rows)):\n            sep_cols.append(c)\n    \n    if len(sep_cols) < 2:\n        return grid\n    \n    # Calculate section dimensions\n    h = sep_rows[0]  # height of sections\n    w = sep_cols[0]  # width of sections\n    \n    # Extract template from top-left section\n    template = []\n    for r in range(h):\n        template.append(grid[r][:w])\n    \n    # Create output as copy of input\n    output = [row[:] for row in grid]\n    \n    # Define section start indices\n    row_starts = [0, sep_rows[0] + 1, sep_rows[1] + 1]\n    col_starts = [0, sep_cols[0] + 1, sep_cols[1] + 1]\n    \n    # Apply template to all sections except top-left\n    for br in range(3):\n        for bc in range(3):\n            if br == 0 and bc == 0:\n                continue\n            \n            r_start = row_starts[br]\n            c_start = col_starts[bc]\n            \n            for i in range(h):\n                for j in range(w):\n                    if template[i][j] != 0:\n                        r = r_start + i\n                        c = c_start + j\n                        if output[r][c] == 0:\n                            output[r][c] = sep_val\n    \n    return output\n```",
  "script": "def solve(grid):\n    if not grid or not grid[0]:\n        return grid\n    \n    rows = len(grid)\n    cols = len(grid[0])\n    \n    # Find separator value and rows\n    sep_val = None\n    sep_rows = []\n    \n    for r in range(rows):\n        first = grid[r][0]\n        if first != 0 and all(grid[r][c] == first for c in range(cols)):\n            if sep_val is None:\n                sep_val = first\n            if grid[r][0] == sep_val:\n                sep_rows.append(r)\n    \n    if sep_val is None or len(sep_rows) < 2:\n        return grid\n    \n    # Find separator columns\n    sep_cols = []\n    for c in range(cols):\n        if all(grid[r][c] == sep_val for r in range(rows)):\n            sep_cols.append(c)\n    \n    if len(sep_cols) < 2:\n        return grid\n    \n    # Calculate section dimensions\n    h = sep_rows[0]  # height of sections\n    w = sep_cols[0]  # width of sections\n    \n    # Extract template from top-left section\n    template = []\n    for r in range(h):\n        template.append(grid[r][:w])\n    \n    # Create output as copy of input\n    output = [row[:] for row in grid]\n    \n    # Define section start indices\n    row_starts = [0, sep_rows[0] + 1, sep_rows[1] + 1]\n    col_starts = [0, sep_cols[0] + 1, sep_cols[1] + 1]\n    \n    # Apply template to all sections except top-left\n    for br in range(3):\n        for bc in range(3):\n            if br == 0 and bc == 0:\n                continue\n            \n            r_start = row_starts[br]\n            c_start = col_starts[bc]\n            \n            for i in range(h):\n                for j in range(w):\n                    if template[i][j] != 0:\n                        r = r_start + i\n                        c = c_start + j\n                        if output[r][c] == 0:\n                            output[r][c] = sep_val\n    \n    return output",
